---
source: src/test/mod.rs
expression: help_text
---
Set the version requirement of a dependency in a crate or workspace

Usage: dependency [OPTIONS] [NAME] [REQ]

Arguments:
  [NAME]
          Name of the dependency

  [REQ]
          Version requirement to set, e.g. `1.2.3`, `~1.2` or `>=1, <2`

Options:
  -r, --registry <REGISTRY>
          Also set a custom registry for the dependency

  -v, --verbose
          Print debug output

  -k, --kind <KIND>
          Only change these kinds of dependency tables instead of all

          Possible values:
          - normal: `[dependencies]`
          - dev:    `[dev-dependencies]`
          - build:  `[build-dependencies]`

  -q, --quiet
          Only print warnings and errors

      --manifest-path <PATH>
          Path to the Cargo.toml (or its directory) of the crate or workspace

  -p, --package <NAME>
          Only change these workspace members instead of all

      --exclude <NAME>
          Do not change these workspace members

  -d, --dry-run
          Show what would be changed without writing any file

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
